    },
    {
      "text": "It says (42:38) \u0623\u064e\u0645\u0652\u0631\u064f\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652 \u0634\u064f\u0648\u0631\u064e\u0649\u0670 \u0628\u064e\u064a\u0652\u0646\u064e\u0647\u064f\u0645\u0652",
      "start": 2029.73,
      "end": 2037.01,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " It",
          "start": 2029.73,
          "end": 2029.81,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
