          "end": 3494.7,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because it's from the, from Malik Al-Mulk (\u0645\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0644\u0650\u0643\u064e \u0671\u0644\u0652\u0645\u064f\u0644\u0652\u0643\u0650).",
