          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " resist",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Why mention Muhammad, Ibrahim, Ali, and 'Ale (family of) Muhammad, 'Ale (family of) Ibrahim.",
