          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And Hussein and Fatima. In Sujud, they were doing this.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Ibrahim.",
