          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " doing",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.  \u0627\u0644\u0644\u064e\u0651\u0647\u064f\u0645\u064e\u0651 \u0635\u064e\u0644\u0650\u0651 \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649 \u0645\u064f\u062d\u064e\u0645\u064e\u0651\u062f",
