          "word": " \u0639\u064e\u0644\u064e\u0649",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Parivash"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Sujud, I was, I was shocked, you know, because the Shia group used to meet here. And I would Pray with them.",
