        },
        {
          "word": " kind",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " shocked",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, we're really blessed to... We take it for granted now that we do the Prayer and there is no name except the name of God.",
