          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, in Iran, we had so many things to do with Muhammad.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " creatures?",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yeah,",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Iran,",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
