        },
        {
          "word": " many",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " things",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " do",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " with",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We had to wear the Chador and cry for  Hussein, Hasan, Ali.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Muhammad.",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " We",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " had",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " wear",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Chador",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " and",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " cry",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " for",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": "  Hussein,",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " Hasan,",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And if we didn't, we were not good person.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Ali.",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " if",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " didn't,",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " were",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " not",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        },
        {
          "word": " good",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "A woman"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. And if you don't cry enough, you beat yourself until you cry.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " person.",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " Yes.",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " if",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " you",
          "start": 3907.5,
