        },
        {
          "word": " always",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, we read in Bukhary\u2019s Hadith, and Al-Suyuty\u2019s Itqaan,",
