        },
        {
          "word": " one",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Right!",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " witness.",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And that is against the Quranic...",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "Azhar Khan",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Right!",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        },
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        },
        {
          "word": " that",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        },
        {
          "word": " against",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3907.5,
          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Azhar Khan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Again, the principle that Abu Bakr and Omar established for writing the Quran down, which was at least two witnesses.",
      "start": 3907.5,
      "end": 3907.5,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
