          "end": 3907.5,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, a messenger has come to you who is fantastic, is false, and then is a Batil (\u0628\u064e\u0640\u0670\u0637\u0650\u0644\u0650), and \"God, there is no god except He is truth.\"",
